    "Free own-cloud 3 git users/3 services/1 cluster; Premium $1000/month up to 10 users/15 services/5 clusters, annual 20% off; Enterprise custom. Infrastructure cost is separate. YC mentions optional fully hosted cluster, but no specific host tariff verified.",
